WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.300
When a buyer says, “Call me next week,”

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.100
agree on when and what you’ll pick up.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.150
Say, “Sure. Would Tuesday at ten Eastern work?

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:13.000
We can pick up on how invoice approvals
work across your branches.”

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.700
If they agree, log the date, time zone and reason.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.800
Mark it as a callback.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.450
When you ring them, say,
“You asked me to call back about invoice approvals.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:26.200
Is now still a good time?”

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.000
Then let them answer.
